 diary:{title:'Bladder diary / frequency-volume chart',fields:[['bdDayVol','24-h urine volume (mL)','number'],['bdFreq','24-h voids','number'],['bdNight','Night-time voids','number'],['bdNightVol','Night-time urine volume (mL)','number'],['bdMax','Maximum voided volume (mL)','number'],['bdUrg','Urgency episodes','number']],guide:'The diary converts symptoms into measured behaviour: frequency, nocturnal urine production, voided volumes and urgency. It can distinguish nocturnal polyuria from reduced bladder capacity patterns.'}
